      "hubble-repair"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "People watched political change, joblessness, crop damage and new films. IBM and Apple were trying an unusual partnership.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The results show both the opportunity and the risk in individual shares. The broad basket gained less than Disney but avoided Apple’s large loss.",
    "what_faded_away": "An exciting partnership announcement did not tell you which partner’s stock would do better. A film review could not predict five years of returns either.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody knew the final company ranking or the size of the ups and downs. Famous names and promising plans left plenty of uncertainty.",
